msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-help-stores.md:72
msgid ""
"This store type represents a store in memory. Store objects can be read and "
"written, but only so long as the store is open. Once the store is closed, "
"all data will be discarded."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-help-stores.md:76
msgid ""
"It's useful when you want to use the Nix evaluator when no actual Nix store "
"exists, e.g."
